      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In narcotized cats different respiratory reactions in acute myocardial ischemia was estimated with complicated and non-complicated ventricular fibrillation. Compensatory mechanism in this state coincided with pulsative electrical activity variation of integrative neurons of ganglion nodosum. Neurons activity variation was detected both in natural and artificial respiration."},
